    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've never heard anyone say it that way. \"the only exit that actually works.\" it's weirdly comforting how you say that... like you actually get how heavy it is. most people just tell me to make a budget or \"stay positive\" but it's just not real. \n\nare you saying there really is no way to fix it? that it's just... inevitable?",
